。&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fo1EquuScBLtf5Y1DXgtepf9eTsiv3.heic" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8dd507cfb5d08b3ee4ea06</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8dd507cfb5d08b3ee4ea06</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:46:47 GMT</pubDate><author>月亮星</author></item><item><title>💟《海豚湾》这个纪录片，非常推荐大家看！！在B站免费可看。1. 希望大家拒绝去海洋馆看海豚表演。长期压抑生活，海豚会自杀。只能活在狭小水域，对海豚非常残...</title><description>💟《海豚湾》这个纪录片，非常推荐大家看！！在B站免费可看。1. 希望大家拒绝去海洋馆看海豚表演。长期压抑生活，海豚会自杀。只能活在狭小水域，对海豚非常残忍残。2，海豚🐬非常善良通人性，还懂得攻击鲨鱼而救人。它和人一样需要到海面呼吸空气。3.日本每年捕杀几万头海豚，非常残忍。4.海豚肉不能食用有重金属，却被日本人包装成鲸鱼肉在售卖。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;————</description><link>https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8dbdcc141b85b292184789</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8dbdcc141b85b292184789</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 16:07:40 GMT</pubDate><author>何不食肉糜_无敌意的坚决</author></item><item><title>准备在回国前看完由索菲亚菲尼斯指导，学术明星齐泽克编剧主持的纪录片《变态者电影指南》。</title><description>准备在回国前看完由索菲亚菲尼斯指导，学术明星齐泽克编剧主持的纪录片《变态者电影指南》。</description><link>https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8d51a4756bbb6658471720</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a8d51a4756bbb6658471720</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 08:26:12 GMT</pubDate><author>seven_游猫猫</author></item><item><title>纪念碑谷西藏版 赖导的视频真夯</title><description>纪念碑谷西藏版&lt;br&gt;赖导的视频真夯&lt;br&gt;&lt;video src="https://videocdnv2.ruguoapp.com/lqHzTVTZKizPmflUOpvKueJfLhjb.mp4?sign=195375687f98d5c1e21e43f68a5fcba1&amp;amp;t=6a9b9817" controls=""&gt;&lt;/video&gt;</description><link>https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a88408cbeeac3aed79eb14b</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6a88408cbeeac3aed79eb14b</guid><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:11:56 GMT</pubDate><author>草莓招了</author></item></channel></rss>